---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Base title="Corrections and removals" description="How to tell us something's wrong, or ask for a listing or image to be removed.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Corrections and Removals</h1>
    <p>If something on Find Me CBR is wrong, tell us. We check every report before changing anything, and fix confirmed mistakes as soon as we can.</p>
    <p>If you run a business and would rather not be listed, tell us and we'll remove the listing. We don't need a reason.</p>
    <p>If an image or text is yours and you didn't give permission for it to be used, tell us and we'll take it down while we look into it.</p>
    <p><em>[Contact details and response times go here before launch.]</em></p>
  </div>
  <a class="rowtile" href="/report/"><span><Icon name="flag" class="lead" /><span>Tell us what's wrong</span></span><Icon name="chevron-right" /></a>
</Base>
